WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.943 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect. You've come a long way. You've awakened.

00:00:03.993 --> 00:00:08.024 line:78%
You've looked honestly at your life. You've made courageous decisions.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:12.623 line:78%
You've established new standards. You've embraced the identity of an Architect.

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:16.358 line:78%
And you've chosen to create a life that extends beyond yourself.

00:00:16.408 --> 00:00:21.533 line:78%
Now you arrive at the final chapter. Or at least... What appears to be the final
chapter.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:24.866 line:78%
Because the truth is, this isn't the end of your Journey.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:27.046 line:78%
It's the beginning of your Back Half.

00:00:27.096 --> 00:00:33.661 line:78%
Everything you've experienced up to this point has been preparing you for what comes
next: Living these decisions.

00:00:33.711 --> 00:00:36.245 line:78%
Every day. Not perfectly. But intentionally.

00:00:36.295 --> 00:00:42.053 line:78%
As you complete this final chapter, remember that transformation isn't measured by
what you've read.

00:00:42.103 --> 00:00:46.594 line:78%
It's measured by the life you choose to create after you close this guidebook.

00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:50.272 line:78%
I'm incredibly proud of the commitment you've made to yourself.

00:00:50.322 --> 00:00:54.123 line:78%
And I'm excited for the life you're about to intentionally create.

00:00:54.173 --> 00:00:55.020 line:78%
Let's begin Chapter Seven.
